p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Essex County has a record from 1951 to 2025, and August to September came in under 90% of normal in 38 of those 75 years. In 2025 the middle ran 138% of normal in April to May and 55% in November to December. This year so far it sat at 60% in January to February 2026 and 99% in June to July 2026. Grid 26936 had its driest year in 1965 at 57%.</p>"}
